				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					1.3.12
				</span></i>
			; <i>persistence, continuance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ αἰσθήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>APo.</u>
					99b36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
